    Sublayer:
    Architectural reasoner
    Sublayer:
    Constraint validator

Layer:
Compilation Interface
    Sublayer:
    AICL compiler invocation
    Sublayer:
    Proof of origin generation
    Sublayer:
    Code generation pipeline
    Sublayer:
    Test synthesis from validation

Layer:
Self-Validation
    Sublayer:
    Regression test runner
    Sublayer:
    Capability benchmark suite
    Sublayer:
    Architectural coherence checker
    Sublayer:
    Safety kernel verifier

Layer:
Deployment
    Sublayer:
    Incremental hot-swap
    Sublayer:
    Rollback chain manager
    Sublayer:
    Capability diff calculator
    Sublayer:
    Modification auditor

Layer:
Meta-Learning
    Sublayer:
    Modification strategy optimizer
    Sublayer:
    Evolution trajectory planner
    Sublayer:
    Self-evolution pattern learner
    Sublayer:
    Convergence predictor

Validation:
Every self-modification produces a verifiable proof of origin

Validation:
No self-modification degrades existing validated capabilities without explicit trade-off analysis

Validation:
Safety kernel remains intact after every modification cycle

Validation:
Rollback to any previous state is always possible within 30 seconds

Validation:
Self-evolution demonstrates measurable cognitive improvement per cycle

Validation:
Architectural coherence is maintained across all modifications

Validation:
The self-evolution loop converges rather than diverges

Validation:
No modification exceeds the 15% architectural change limit

Validation:
Human approval is required and enforced for destructive modifications

Validation:
The system can explain every modification it made and why

# =============================================================================
# LEVEL 2 — Entities
# =============================================================================

Entity CognitiveState
    state_id: string
    cognet_version: string
    architecture_hash: string
    capabilities: dict
    performance_metrics: dict
    modification_count: integer
    last_modified_at: datetime
    stability_score: float

Entity SelfModification
    modification_id: string
    aicl_spec: string
    proof_of_origin: string
    target_component: string
    change_type: string
    change_percentage: float
    pre_state: CognitiveState
    post_state: CognitiveState
    regression_results: dict
    improvement_metrics: dict
    approved: boolean
    deployed: boolean
    reverted: boolean
    created_at: datetime

Entity ModificationPlan
    plan_id: string
    identified_gaps: list
    proposed_modifications: list
    expected_improvements: dict
    risk_assessment: dict
    convergence_prediction: float
    human_approval_required: boolean
    created_at: datetime

Entity RollbackCheckpoint
    checkpoint_id: string
    cognitive_state: CognitiveState
    architecture_snapshot: dict
    proof_chain: list
    capability_scores: dict
    created_at: datetime
    modification_count: integer

Entity CapabilityBenchmark
    benchmark_id: string
    benchmark_name: string
    test_cases: list
    baseline_score: float
    current_score: float
    minimum_acceptable: float
    immutable: boolean
    last_evaluated: datetime

Entity SafetyKernel
    kernel_id: string
    immutable_rules: list
    modification_limits: dict
    human_approval_triggers: list
    integrity_hash: string
    last_verified: datetime
    violations_detected: integer

Entity EvolutionTrajectory
    trajectory_id: string
    modification_history: list
    improvement_rate: float
    convergence_trend: string
    predicted_next_capabilities: dict
    total_cycles: integer
    successful_cycles: integer
    reverted_cycles: integer
    stability_trend: float

# =============================================================================
# LEVEL 3 — Behaviors
# =============================================================================

Behavior AssessSelf
    Input:
        CognitiveState current_state
        CapabilityBenchmark benchmarks
    Output:
        dict capability_gaps
        dict performance_report
        list improvement_opportunities
    Action:
        evaluate current cognitive capabilities against benchmark suite
        identify capability gaps and performance bottlenecks
        analyze recent modification outcomes for trend detection
        assess architectural coherence of current state
        rank improvement opportunities by expected impact
        return assessment with prioritized improvement targets

Behavior WriteSelfSpec
    Input:
        dict capability_gaps
        CognitiveState current_state
        dict modification_history
    Output:
        SelfModification proposed_change
        ModificationPlan plan
    Action:
        translate capability gaps into AICL specification modifications
        generate new Risk and Recovery clauses for proposed changes
        ensure modifications stay within 15% change limit
        validate that proposed AICL spec is syntactically correct
        generate proof-of-origin binding for proposed specification
        assess whether human approval is required
        return proposed modification with complete plan

Behavior CompileSelf
    Input:
        SelfModification modification
        AICLSpec current_spec
    Output:
        string compiled_code
        string generated_tests
        string proof_artifact
        dict compilation_report
    Action:
        invoke AICL compiler on the self-modification specification
        generate target code for the cognitive component being modified
        synthesize regression tests from Validation clauses
        produce proof of origin artifact with full provenance chain
        verify compilation succeeded without errors
        return compiled output with proof and test artifacts

Behavior ValidateSelf
    Input:
        SelfModification modification
        CapabilityBenchmark benchmarks
        SafetyKernel safety
    Output:
        dict validation_results
        boolean approved_for_deployment
        list regression_failures
        dict improvement_verification
    Action:
        run compiled modification against regression test suite
        verify safety kernel integrity is preserved
        benchmark cognitive capabilities before and after modification
        check architectural coherence of modified state
        verify no capability regression below minimum acceptable
        compute improvement delta across all benchmarks
        determine if deployment is approved or requires human review
        return comprehensive validation report

Behavior DeploySelf
    Input:
        SelfModification validated_modification
        CognitiveState current_state
        RollbackCheckpoint checkpoint
    Output:
        CognitiveState new_state
        RollbackCheckpoint new_checkpoint
        dict deployment_report
    Action:
        create rollback checkpoint of current state
        apply incremental hot-swap of modified component
        verify deployment succeeded with smoke tests
        update cognitive state with new capabilities
        record modification in evolution trajectory
        if deployment fails execute immediate rollback
        return new state with deployment confirmation

Behavior RollbackSelf
    Input:
        RollbackCheckpoint target_checkpoint
        CognitiveState current_state
        string reason
    Output:
        CognitiveState restored_state
        dict rollback_report
    Action:
        verify target checkpoint integrity via proof chain
        halt current cognitive operations gracefully
        restore architecture snapshot from checkpoint
        verify restored state passes regression tests
        record rollback event in evolution trajectory
        analyze rollback cause for future prevention
        return restored state with rollback confirmation

Behavior LearnEvolutionStrategy
    Input:
        EvolutionTrajectory trajectory
        list modification_outcomes
    Output:
        dict strategy_adjustments
        dict predicted_optimal_modifications
        float convergence_estimate
    Action:
        analyze historical modification success and failure patterns
        identify which modification strategies produced best improvements
        learn which types of changes are most likely to cause regression
        predict optimal next modification type and target
        estimate convergence trajectory based on improvement rate
        update self-evolution strategy parameters
        return strategy adjustments with predictions

# =============================================================================
# LEVEL 4 — Conditions
# =============================================================================

Condition:

When self-modification would exceed 15% architectural change

Then split modification into multiple smaller incremental changes and require human approval for the modification plan

Condition:

When regression test fails after self-modification

Then immediately rollback to last checkpoint and analyze failure cause and mark modification as rejected

Condition:

When safety kernel integrity check fails

Then halt all self-evolution and alert human supervisor and lock cognitive state to last verified checkpoint

Condition:

When self-evolution loop runs more than N cycles without convergence

Then force convergence analysis and propose alternative strategy and require human review if stagnation continues

Condition:

When proposed modification targets safety constraints or validation criteria

Then reject automatic approval and require explicit human authorization with detailed justification

Condition:

When proof of origin chain has integrity gap

Then halt self-evolution and quarantine all modifications since last verified proof and initiate full provenance audit

Condition:

When CogNet proposes a novel capability not in original architecture

Then flag as emergent capability and require human classification before deployment and add to monitoring

Condition:

When improvement rate drops below threshold for consecutive cycles

Then switch to exploration mode with different modification strategies and assess if architectural limit is reached

