Action:
    create new checkpoint and update evolution trajectory and emit improvement metrics

Event:

On rollback executed

Action:
    verify restored state stability and record rollback cause and adjust evolution strategy

Event:

On emergent capability detected

Action:
    flag for human classification and add enhanced monitoring and assess safety implications

Event:

On convergence achieved

Action:
    freeze current architecture and report evolution summary and propose next evolution phase

